# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PhARMA RAG — local development secrets
#
# HOW TO USE
#   cp .env.example .env      (Windows:  copy .env.example .env)
#   then paste your key(s) below.
#
# `.env` is git-ignored and is NEVER committed. No key appears anywhere in the
# source code — llm_providers.py reads them at runtime from, in order:
#   1. st.secrets   (Streamlit Cloud → Settings → Secrets)
#   2. environment variables
#   3. this .env file
#
# You need AT MOST ONE of the three cloud providers. With none set the app still
# runs and still cites sources — it answers extractively from retrieved text.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── PRIMARY PROVIDER: OpenRouter — one key, many models, real free tier ─────
# Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPTIONAL. Leave unset to use the built-in free-model chain, which walks past
# any slug that has been retired or rate-limited (see llm_providers.py).
# Set this only to pin one specific model:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b:free

# ── 2nd priority: Google Gemini ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# ── 3rd priority: Groq — fastest free inference ─────────────────────────────
# Get one at https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ── 4th priority: Ollama — local, private, no key required ──────────────────
# Install from https://ollama.com then:  ollama pull llama3.2
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.2:latest
